  "known_learner_copy_debt": [
    "The word 'representation' still appears inside upstream-authored body copy that comes from the C-G problem-authoring templates, the promoted-PCK registry and the C-H primitive descriptions. It is barred from headings by forbidden_heading_phrases but is not yet barred everywhere, because rewriting that copy is a subject-authoring change rather than a renderer change. It is queued for the next authoring-copy pass and is deliberately NOT listed in forbidden_anywhere_phrases so this registry does not claim a cleanliness it has not got.",
    "Chemistry-specific role titles beyond this table (for example a future 'lab safety note' role) must be added here before a renderer may print them; an unmapped role fails closed with LEARNER_TITLE_MISSING_FOR_ROLE rather than falling back to the internal identifier."
  ],
